
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Login - Copie le token "access" de la réponse
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "husmar",
  "password": "#Cool045"
}

###

@access_token = {{login.response.body.access}}

### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{login.response.body.refresh}}"
}

### Liste des reservations (filtrees)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/?platform=parkos&service_type=parking&status=confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Reservations a venir
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/upcoming/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Reservations passees
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/past/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Stats reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/stats/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Forcer synchro compte email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/email-accounts/1/sync/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 🧪 Tester la connexion OAuth (récupère les 5 derniers emails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email-accounts/1/test_connection/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Marquer un email comme lu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/emails/1/mark_read/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

## 📡 Endpoints API pour React
```
# Auth
POST /api/token/                        # Login (retourne access + refresh token)
POST /api/token/refresh/                # Refresh token

# Comptes email
GET    /api/email-accounts/             # Liste
POST   /api/email-accounts/             # Créer
GET    /api/email-accounts/{id}/        # Détails
PUT    /api/email-accounts/{id}/        # Modifier
DELETE /api/email-accounts/{id}/        # Supprimer
POST   /api/email-accounts/{id}/sync/   # Forcer synchro

# Emails
GET /api/emails/                        # Liste
GET /api/emails/{id}/                   # Détails
POST /api/emails/{id}/mark_read/        # Marquer lu

# Réservations
GET    /api/reservations/               # Liste (filtres: ?platform=parkos&service_type=parking&status=confirmed)
GET    /api/reservations/{id}/          # Détails
PUT    /api/reservations/{id}/          # Modifier
DELETE /api/reservations/{id}/          # Supprimer
GET    /api/reservations/upcoming/      # À venir
GET    /api/reservations/past/          # Passées
GET    /api/reservations/stats/         # Statistiques

# Logs
GET /api/sync-logs/                     # Historique synchros